# ⚠ DO NOT ignore content/articles/_embeddings.json.
# The reference repo ignored it; that was wrong. The dashboard reads its COMMIT AGE
# to report embedding-cache staleness, so an ignored cache makes that panel lie —
# and CI re-embeds the whole corpus every run instead of reusing it. Commit it.
